    {
      "id": 980000000106,
      "plugin": "Cardinal",
      "model": "TextEditor",
      "version": "2.0",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "width": 34,
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / ORIGINAL FIRST-PARTY PERFORMANCE\nMOONLIT HARMONIC MINOR -- CLOCKED CHANCE DRIFT\n\nPLAY: Host MIDI pitch -> ScaleQuantizer D harmonic\nminor (ROOT D=2, SCALE HARMONIC MINOR=4),\n13-cent hysteresis -> SlewGlide EXP -> MorphVCO\npitch 1V/oct. Quantizer CHANGE (+10V 2ms) ->\nFundamental ADSR RETRIG; MIDI gate -> ADSR GATE.\nThis is monophonic HostMIDI (channel 1), not\n8-voice/polyphonic. Play adjacent chromatic notes\nto hear the characteristic harmonic-minor pull.\n\nMorphVCO -> DualVCA (ADSR controls CV) ->\nStateFilter. Filter LP -> StereoEcho L; HP -> R.\nEcho left/right -> independent HostAudio2 L/R.\nLow monitor gain; warm, sparse single-line MIDI.\n\nSELF-RUNNING CONTROL CLOCK (NOT HOST TEMPO):\nClockedLFO PULSE at 0.35Hz/duty28% clocks the\nChanceHold CLOCK input. ChanceHold 67% chance\non each pulse; glide 0.85s; fixed-seed RNG.\nChanceHold GLIDE -> StateFilter cutoff 1V/oct.\nChanceHold HOLD -> StateFilter drive (+10V=100%).\nThese are free-running modulation CV paths;\nno transport synchronization is claimed.\n\nMacro8 unipolar outputs:\n0 TIME -> Echo time input2 (+100ms/V)\n1 FEEDBACK -> Echo feedback input3\n2 WET -> Echo wet input4\n3 WAVE -> MorphVCO wave shape input2\n4 GLIDE -> SlewGlide RISE & FALL CV (+5s/10V).\nGlide base rise 0.12s, fall 0.18s;\nmacro scenes add 0.125/0.4/0.7/1.05s.\n\nFour smoothly recalled manual scenes (1.2s):\nA VEIL   -- short delay, fast glide\nB REACH  -- warmer echo, moderate glide\nC SPELL  -- clear echo and long transitions\nD NOCTURNE -- ambient, longest portamento.\n\nManual scene recall only; neither real host\naudio, preset reopen nor host MIDI audition\nwas carried out for this source factory patch.\n"
      },
      "pos": [
        167,
        0
      ]
    },
